         ("What does Kamala mean by «A translator is not a dictionary»?", "Translation should convey effect and feeling, not just word-for-word meaning.", ["Translators should never use dictionaries.", "Dictionaries are often wrong.", "Translators need to know more words than dictionaries.", "Translation is easier than writing a dictionary."]),
